    "body": "Ahh. And in trying just now to fix it, I realize why I just logged to the console. And it's the same reason you got here. What global do I fire that exception on, given that this exception is coming from the parser, and not a JS call like `attachShadow`. Does [your PR](https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/10404) clarify this for me somehow?",
